ouble nut system with special anti-rust paint finish</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Back stop mechanism is used to minimize loosening.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The butt cap is made of BRC</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Total length (m): 3.04</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Number of joints (pieces): 2</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Weight (g): 394</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Lure Jig: 80-150</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Lure Piug&plusmn;20g: 100</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Line (PE size): 5-8</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Drag Max (kg): 10</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Power: XH</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Action (condition): Fast</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Tip diameter (mm): 3.0</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Made in Japan</span></p>","likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":1,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/shop/catalog/p/rodcom-straight-shore-ss-10015-sf047y","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff069cde136752810907ec8/fb3b3acc-4059-4caa-b9c2-2a80b31483e3/rodcom.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","structuredContent":{"_type":"StoreItem","priceCents":0,"salePriceCents":0,"priceMoney":{"currency":"EUR","value":"0.00"},"salePriceMoney":{"currency":"EUR","value":"0.00"},"onSale":false,"productType":1,"customAddButtonText":"Add 